    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned mansion filled with mysteries, dangers, and an oppressive atmosphere. In this survival and exploration game, you take on the role of a character who must uncover what happened in this place while facing terrifying creatures and solving challenging puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Navigate through narrow hallways, dark rooms, and outdoor areas of the mansion, each hiding secrets and unexpected dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Challenges:</strong> Solve intricate and interactive puzzles that block your progress, requiring reasoning and keen observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Combat:</strong> Face bizarre and terrifying creatures using improvised tools, or choose to avoid them depending on your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> Detailed graphics and carefully crafted sound design create an experience that keeps you on edge at all times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Story:</strong> Discover fragments of information about what happened in the mansion. Every clue brings you closer to the truth, but beware of what you might find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> The mansion evolves over time, presenting new threats and challenges as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to survive what lurks in the darkness?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned mansion filled with mysteries, dangers, and an oppressive atmosphere. In this survival and exploration game, you take on the role of a character who must uncover what happened in this place while facing terrifying creatures and solving challenging puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Navigate through narrow hallways, dark rooms, and outdoor areas of the mansion, each hiding secrets and unexpected dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Challenges:</strong> Solve intricate and interactive puzzles that block your progress, requiring reasoning and keen observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Combat:</strong> Face bizarre and terrifying creatures using improvised tools, or choose to avoid them depending on your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> Detailed graphics and carefully crafted sound design create an experience that keeps you on edge at all times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Story:</strong> Discover fragments of information about what happened in the mansion. Every clue brings you closer to the truth, but beware of what you might find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> The mansion evolves over time, presenting new threats and challenges as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to survive what lurks in the darkness?</p>",
